| Memory: the three clips with every picture checked in PCI memory (-m pci),
| copied out by LDM 8 in SVC mode: what vcdec 0.4 falls back to when it
| can't have a Physical Memory Pool. Reports to ResultM.
| (a GCCSDK program: needs SharedUnixLibrary and ARMEABISupport loaded)
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 IfThere System:Modules.SharedULib Then RMLoad System:Modules.SharedULib
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 Error This needs SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 or later. Install it with PackMan.
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0 IfThere System:Modules.ARMEABISupport Then RMLoad System:Modules.ARMEABISupport
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0 Error This needs the ARMEABISupport module. Install it with PackMan.
WimpSlot -min 16384K -max 16384K
Remove <Obey$Dir>.ResultM
Run <Obey$Dir>.vcdectest -m pci -o <Obey$Dir>.ResultM <Obey$Dir>.clips.small.mp4 <Obey$Dir>.clips.small.crc <Obey$Dir>.clips.small.sig
Run <Obey$Dir>.vcdectest -m pci -o <Obey$Dir>.ResultM <Obey$Dir>.clips.odd.mp4 <Obey$Dir>.clips.odd.crc <Obey$Dir>.clips.odd.sig
Run <Obey$Dir>.vcdectest -m pci -o <Obey$Dir>.ResultM <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.mp4 <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.crc <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.sig
